WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.550
You can calculate pot odds in your head.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.600
But answering whether you’re coming Saturday

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.500
takes three business days?

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:07.350
Floor!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.300
Can we get a clock on this guy?

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.800
We’re not asking you to call an all-in.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.650
We’re asking if you’re available.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.300
Open the yellow chip.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.370
Choose your name.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.250
Tap In,

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:17.900
Maybe,

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:18.650
or Out.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.650
It’s TLPT RSVP.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:22.650
Three choices.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:24.670
None of them needs a time bank.
